{"title":"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 23","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/c/73c2cebdbc524624cf9bab853640b2d6e8b00320.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,y&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/f/1efaa8d21ffac03c4164e8af0921b1e7834f0e1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_y(x)+\\log_x(y)=\\frac{10}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"182\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/3/f33a4848d2361671d1f622a8c231cd5b0e8ea8c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy=144$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"71\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/4/30425369fc0ed235503b24a4585dda454df442b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x+y}{2}=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"67\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/2/222c34d750c8b50a15075c5e0c35e2b8314d0fa8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 12\\sqrt{2} \\quad \\textbf{(B) } 13\\sqrt{3} \\quad \\textbf{(C) } 24 \\quad \\textbf{(D) } 30 \\quad \\textbf{(E) } 36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"383\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/f/48f6a9bfd3846e4e4681366683e0a978d0b84c7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u = \\log_y(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"92\" height=\"22\" />.  Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/5/c555a99a910d96e426f873cc478a1ebb9414da99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_x(y) = \\frac{1}{u}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"96\" height=\"38\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/2/2e273356b814248514602797be7fff292d376413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u + \\frac{1}{u} = \\frac{u^2+1}{u} = \\frac{10}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"173\" height=\"41\" />.  \n</p><p>Cross-multiplying and factoring yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/2/cb2a1b935e260019b60fcb33394d66d748992d63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3u^2 - 10u + 3 = (3u-1)(u-3) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"289\" height=\"21\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/c/c4cb620581f712aa9a7330ce15f752215010c4b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u = \\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/7/a879f9bf4ca7eb329c89bf3beacc1234fb7a31e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />.  Thus either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/d/48dd428e8867cfe89522d80f2d791730e7183fed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = y^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"20\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/1/1d1f22f0eb531f524959e841dd394d02355ec5fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = y^{\\frac{1}{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"56\" height=\"23\" />, that is, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/d/48dd428e8867cfe89522d80f2d791730e7183fed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = y^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"20\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/c/c1cd802668d40de66f9c15973b3b0b340627e443.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = x^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"20\" />.    \n</p><p>Without loss of generality, suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/d/48dd428e8867cfe89522d80f2d791730e7183fed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = y^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"20\" />.  Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/6/2b6457618b85ce5050569c11bd3635b7f6e9c225.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^4 = 144$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"70\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/2/672b658a968530daf408723c8f428cca4c35b530.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\sqrt[4]{144} = 2\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"136\" height=\"23\" />.  Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/2/be2c52934f1c0e97113a69005526cb59747e318d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 24\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"79\" height=\"21\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/5/d050e4f543735dd6ee281775d7b6eaf081087d58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x + y}{2} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 13\\sqrt{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"160\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME\" title=\"1990 AHSME\">1990 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1990 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1990\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\